  "spam_probability": 0.02,
  "toxicity": 0.03,
  "language_confidence": 0.98,
  "novelty": 0.77
}
```

Lalu:

```text
curated_score =
    quality
    × context
    × novelty
    × authenticity
```

Jadi dataset matang bukan sekadar "komentar yang bersih".

